+# S5-CLM-00003492
+
+Complete worker candidate for the Formal Conjectures replay theorem
+`Arxiv.«1609.08688».maximalLength_le`: the maximal length of a pairwise
+two-coordinate-increasing list of triples from `[1,n]` is at most `n²`.
+
+The active Lean package uses `Mathlib` and proves the fully delta-expanded
+proposition independently by finite pigeonhole. The frozen numeric provider
+module is retained only as exact provenance because it is not a parseable
+canonical Lake import. `Statement.lean` provides the statement crosswalk,
+`Proof.lean` provides the proof, and `Audit.lean` provides both semantic
+transport directions. The JSON artifacts bind identity, anchors, the typed
+DAG, machine closure, readable reverse coverage, validation trace, and the
+provisional release decision.
+
+Worker status is self-tested and provisional. Only canonical Master may
+compile at trust zero, recompute semantic hashes, accept the package, and
+advance the theorem checklist.
